--
-- Values are quote_nullable(col::text), NOT to_jsonb. Two bugs made that necessary
-- and both were caught by the round-trip below rather than by reading:
--   * jsonb_each_text does not preserve ordinal_position, so a naive build wrote
--     values into the wrong columns entirely (id, orcid, country, last_name, ...
--     against id, identity_hash, npi_number, orcid, ...).
--   * to_jsonb renders a text[] as [] which is not a valid array literal; ::text
--     renders {} which round-trips.
--
-- VERIFIED 2026-08-18 by delete -> restore -> compare inside a rolled-back
-- transaction: 1,093 rows restored, 0 lost_or_changed, 0 spurious, on a
